{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42781","headline":"春宴河亭 · 刘兼","name":"春宴河亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳摆轻丝拂嫩黄，槛前流水满池塘。\n一筵金翠临芳岸，四面烟花出粉墙。\n舞袖逐风翻绣浪，歌尘随燕下雕梁。\n蛮笺象管休凝思，且放春心入醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}